{
  "_doc": "docs/vjpad.md — layout config for vjpad.html. Edit this file to set knob numbers, labels, banks and pads for any shader. Everything here is checked in and shared; per-phone tweaks made in the pad's EDIT screen layer on top and stay on that phone.",

  "_match": "A bank appears when one of its `match` globs matches the shader selected in the strip. `*` = always. `a/b/*` = prefix.",

